{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/639845-fae-body-snatcher-idea","id":639845,"title":"Fae body snatcher idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-25T22:01:59-07:00","id":639845,"title":"Fae body snatcher idea","content":"So I know the Fae will often capture a human and leave a fetch behind but I was wondering has anyone considered the idea of a mass abduction, replacing the citizens of an entire town with fetches? Fetches that become extremely hostile once their cover has been exposed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T22:11:02-07:00","id":639870,"title":"","content":"There was a True Fae who did that in our last game, and came to our attention when a group was fiddling with the Hedge in a way they really, really shouldn't have been. It let one of its victims, the leader of the group, go after a long transformative Durance, releasing him at a time before he was captured, since he was so arrogant even warnings from something claiming to be his future self wouldn't deter him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T22:13:29-07:00","id":639872,"title":"","content":"I've got a town where about 40% of the population are Fetches written up as a setting for a future game. Haven't had a chance to run it yet, since future Changeling games are on hold until I can have the second edition in my hands. Mass abductions, or simply places with an unfortunately prominent position on well-travelled trods, are certainly ideas I've toyed with before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T23:01:13-07:00","id":639884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Azahul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/639845-fae-body-snatcher-idea?p=639872#post639872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got a town where about 40% of the population are Fetches written up as a setting for a future game. Haven't had a chance to run it yet, since future Changeling games are on hold until I can have the second edition in my hands. Mass abductions, or simply places with an unfortunately prominent position on well-travelled trods, are certainly ideas I've toyed with before.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if you get around to it let me know how it works out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}